### Why this patch?
 * Keep span limits independent of environment variables while preserving caller-provided defaults.
 * Replace the excluded upstream implementation with one that returns its argument unchanged.
diff --git a/sdk/src/trace/span_limits.cc b/sdk/src/trace/span_limits.cc
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sdk/src/trace/span_limits.cc
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
